  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement : 108 ÷ 9 × 16 + 12 - 27 = 126\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the two numbers :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 12 and 27 \n\n108 ÷ 9 × 16 + 12 - 27 = 126 ⇒ **108 ÷ 9**__ × 16 + 27 - 12 = 126\n\n__**12 × 16**__ + 27 - 12 = 126\n\n__**192 + 27**__ - 12 = 126\n\n__**219 - 12**__ = 126\n\n207 ≠ 126 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 9 and 12 \n\n108 ÷ 9 × 16 + 12 - 27 = 126 ⇒ **108 ÷ 12**__ × 16 + 9 - 27 = 126\n\n__**9 × 16**__ + 9 - 27 = 126\n\n__**144 + 9**__ - 27 = 126\n\n__**153 - 27**__ = 126\n\n126 = 126 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 16 and 9\n\n108 ÷ 9 × 16 + 12 - 27 = 126 ⇒ **108 ÷ 16**__ × 9 + 12 - 27 = 126\n\n__**6.75 **____**× 9**__ + 12 - 27 = 126\n\n__**60.75 + 12**__ - 27 = 126\n\n__**72.75 - 27**__ = 126\n\n45.75 ≠ 126 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 27 and 9 \n\n108 ÷ 9 × 16 + 12 - 27 = 126 ⇒ **108 ÷ 27**__ × 16 + 12 - 9 = 126\n\n__**4 **____**× 16**__ + 12 - 9 = 126\n\n__**64 + 12**__ - 9 = 126\n\n__**78 **____**- 9**__ = 126\n\n69 ≠ 126 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (2)\" is the correct answer.",
